  "releaseNotes": "DotCov 4.7.1 is a toolchain maintenance release: it builds with .NET SDK 10.0.402 and ANcpLua.Analyzers 2.1.8.\nThe test project drops the redundant VSTest bridge property; global.json already selects Microsoft.Testing.Platform.\nCLI behavior, coverage gates, exit codes and JSON output contracts are unchanged from 4.7.0.\nFull notes: https://github.com/ANcpLua/dotcov/blob/main/docs/releases/4.7.1.md",
